        },
        "CAUSES & RISK FACTORS": {
          "present": true,
          "status": "content",
          "source_heading": "CAUSES & RISK FACTORS",
          "canonical_heading": "CAUSES & RISK FACTORS",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Mode of inheritance is being studied; an autosomal recessive mode of inheritance is documented in the standard poodle and suspected in the Akita.",
              "pdf_page": 1306,
              "printed_page": 1224,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Multiple pathophysiologic causes theorized including autoimmunity against sebaceous glands and/or leakage of sebaceous gland contents into surrounding dermis causing an inflammatory reaction and eventual destruction of glands.",
              "pdf_page": 1306,
              "printed_page": 1224,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Destruction of sebaceous glands may be",
              "pdf_page": 1306,
              "printed_page": 1224,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Cyclosporine 5 mg/kg PO q12–24h; side secondary—“innocent bystander” from other effects include vomiting, diarrhea, gingival inflammatory conditions. hyperplasia, hirsutism, papillomatous skin lesions, increased incidence of infections, nephrotoxicity, and hepatotoxicity.",
              "pdf_page": 1306,
              "printed_page": 1224,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Doxycycline 5 mg/kg PO q12h and niacinamide 250 mg PO q8h,<10 kg;",
              "pdf_page": 1306,
              "printed_page": 1224,
              "column": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
